From 3abcc2c929f5919372db6ea5b7c2f53c5653cc9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 03:08:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: apple: mca: support the T8132 banked TX path

Describe register layout and clocking differences through variant data. Add the T8132 banked aperture, fixed-parent clock divider and staged TX enable sequence, exposing the supported TX0 route without capture.

Extend the binding for the single register region, clock and DMA channel while retaining the earlier hardware requirements.

Validation: the affected object builds; binding schema validation passed. The complete speaker path was exercised on native T8132 kernel #109.

Assisted-By: OpenAI Codex (GPT-6 Astra)
Assisted-By: Claude Code (Claude Fable 5.1)
Signed-off-by: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
